Explanation: The code comment "@@@ If the return value is negative, last index of x in old array is -1" corresponds to the assertion statement "Debug.Assert(New_Ret < 0 ? Old_arrListLastIndexOfX == -1 : true);". This assert statement checks if the return value (New_Ret) is negative, in which case, it asserts that the last index of x in the old array should be -1.--------------------
